      "verbatim_texts": [
        "And if the answer is \"Yes\" again, then we enter the invoice in SAP."
      ],
      "justification": "Covers the subsequent branching logic, intermediate checks, and final invoice entry steps described in the sequential flow. Behaviour is preserved despite explicit modeling of implicit evaluations."
    },
    {
